`--step` is the sub-agent's fetch surface: it prints that step's body alone — no preamble, no step
table, no `## Step:` heading — and records the invocation in the attached vault's log.

-- fixtures/cwd/vault/_playbooks/fx-step-fetch/playbook.md --
